      "Width": 300,
      "Height": 400,
      "TopText": "\u628A\u4E0A\u4E00\u7BC7\u6539\u5BEB\u6210\u82F1\u6587",
      "BottomText": "National Taipei University of Education (NTUE), located in Da\u2019an District, Taipei City, was founded in 1895 and is the oldest educational institution in Taiwan, specializing in the training of elementary school teachers.\n\nThe university has three colleges: Education, Humanities and Arts, and Science. It has 205 full-time faculty members and about 5,800 students. Its graduate employment rate has long remained above 98%, and its teacher recruitment exam pass rate is also outstanding.\n\nIts major departments include the Department of Education, Department of Music, Department of Children English Education, and Department of Arts and Design. The university also actively promotes bilingual education policies.",
